  "description": "Syncfusion® Blazor Chart3D component library provides interactive 3D chart visualizations for Blazor applications. Includes support for various chart types (accumulation, bullet, range navigator, sparkline, smith chart, stock chart) with data binding, export capabilities (PDF, Excel), and responsive design across Blazor Server and WebAssembly platforms targeting .NET 8, .NET 9, and .NET 10.",
